# Conformance probe pack for ruling 9 of 0.56: two keys on one member, the second
# with a range. Every held line is checked, so a held probe.y outside 0..10 refuses
# the encode even though probe.x is the value written. Public. No kinds.
format  conformance-range-056-1
version 0.56.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses    probe
wire    json
field   probe.x  v  int
field   probe.y  v  int  range 0 10
